{
  "html": "\u003csection data-no-dark=\"\" id=\"cw-layout-magazine\" class=\"cw-reading-rhythm-v3\" style=\"background-color: #e8f7f8; box-sizing: border-box; color: #194c58; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \u0026#39;PingFang SC\u0026#39;, \u0026#39;Microsoft YaHei\u0026#39;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; overflow-wrap: anywhere; padding: 26px 24px; width: 100%; word-break: break-word\"\u003e\u003csection style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #194c58; margin: 0; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; max-width: 100%; padding: 0; width: 100%\"\u003e\u003csection style=\"background-image: url(\u0026#34;data:image/png;base64,\u0026#34;); background-position: top; background-repeat: repeat-x; background-size: 160px 80px; border: 0; border-bottom: 5px double #176c83; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0 0 26px; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; padding: 38px 16px 28px; width: 100%\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"background: transparent; border: 0; box-sizing: border-box; color: #194c58; display: block; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.95; margin: 0; max-width: 100%; padding: 0; text-align: left; width: auto\"\u003e阳光在水面折出细碎波光，把夏日泳池边的清凉与松弛原封不动寄到你眼前。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 1.8; margin: 20px auto 0; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; text-align: left; width: 100%\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/wendao-ai/wendao-ai-template-market/raw/sample-images/summer-coast.jpg\" alt=\"阳光海岸清透泳池与洁白遮阳伞\" style=\"display: block; height: auto; margin: 0; width: 100%\"/\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003csection style=\"background: transparent; border: 0; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 32px 0 0; margin-bottom: 0; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; padding: 16px 0; padding-bottom: 0; padding-top: 0; width: 100%\"\u003e\u003ch2 style=\"background: transparent; border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #176c83; color: #194c58; display: block; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \u0026#39;PingFang SC\u0026#39;, \u0026#39;Microsoft YaHei\u0026#39;, sans-serif; font-size: 23px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 16px; padding: 12px 0 10px; text-align: left; text-indent: 0; width: auto\"\u003e把海风与水波光铺进版面\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp style=\"color: #194c58; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.95; margin: 0 0 18px\"\u003e淡蓝青水波底纹清爽通透不抢文字，配合顶置海景大片，打开瞬间降温五度。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cblockquote style=\"background-color: #cbeaf0; border: 0; border-radius: 60px 0 60px 0; color: #194c58; font-size: 21px; line-height: 1.85; margin: 24px 0; padding: 28px 20px; text-align: center\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"color: inherit; font-size: inherit; font-weight: inherit; line-height: inherit; margin: 0 0 12px\"\u003e夏天的快乐很简单，一阵海风、一杯冰饮和一段不被打扰的午后。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003csection style=\"background: transparent; border: 0; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 32px 0 0; margin-bottom: 0; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; padding: 16px 0; padding-bottom: 0; padding-top: 0; width: 100%\"\u003e\u003ch2 style=\"background: transparent; border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #176c83; color: #194c58; display: block; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \u0026#39;PingFang SC\u0026#39;, \u0026#39;Microsoft YaHei\u0026#39;, sans-serif; font-size: 23px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 16px; padding: 12px 0 10px; text-align: left; text-indent: 0; width: auto\"\u003e夏日系图文的清爽秘诀\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul style=\"margin: 0 0 16px; padding-left: 22px\"\u003e\u003cli style=\"margin: 0 0 8px; padding-left: 3px\"\u003e水波纹理 PNG 还原阳光折射波光感\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"margin: 0 0 8px; padding-left: 3px\"\u003e顶置大图一秒拉满清凉度假氛围\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"margin: 0 0 8px; padding-left: 3px\"\u003e高可读青蓝配色让长文轻盈不闷\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp style=\"border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #4b707b; color: #194c58; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.95; margin: 32px 0 0; padding: 18px 0 0; text-align: left\"\u003e祝你拥有一个透明、发亮又自由的夏天。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003c/section\u003e",
